{"id":"slabtop.1","lang":"en","desc":"Display kernel slab cache information in real time.","items":[["Start `slabtop`","sudo slabtop"],["Sort by [c]ache size","sudo slabtop {{[-s|--sort]}} c"],["Sort by number of [o]bjects","sudo slabtop {{[-s|--sort]}} o"],["Sort by object [s]ize","sudo slabtop {{[-s|--sort]}} s"],["Display once and then exit","sudo slabtop {{[-o|--once]}}"],["Display help","slabtop {{[-h|--help]}}"]],"version":"v2.3","source":"https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/main/pages/linux/slabtop.md"}